  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt; 100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점을 못받게 하는 고교시험</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">바꿔야 합니다 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">지필고사에서 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점을 받으면 선생님이 우수한 성취결과를 얻은 학생들을 격려하는 것이 정상적인 교실의 모습입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그런데 현재 고등학교는 학생들이 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점을 못 받게 하는 기이한 상황이 발생하고 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고교 교사는 고백합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점 맞는 학생 수를 줄여 내신 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등급</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상위 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4%) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">비율을 맞추려고 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시험 문제에 함정을 만들고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 함정에 빠져서 오답을 체크하길 기대합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.’</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이런 비교육적인 행위를 하는 교사의 마음은 무겁습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">B</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고교 학생들은 고백합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">시험 문제가 어려워서 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점이 조금 나왔으면 좋겠어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.’</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">( </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">나만 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점 맞기를 기대하며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다른 사람이 망해야 내가 잘된다는 잠재적 교육과정을 배우고 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이러한 문제의 큰 원인은</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등수로 줄 세우는 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상대평가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">때문입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점 맞는 학생들이 많을수록 성취기준에 많이 도달했다고 할 수 있는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">현재의 상황은 열심히 배우고 익혀서 수십 명의 학생들이 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">점을 받으면 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그 누구도 내신 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등급을 받지 못하는 문제가 발생하는 비정상적인 시스템이 작동하고 있습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">독일 교육의 초석을 놓은 테오도어 아도르노는 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육에서 경쟁은 야만행위</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">라는 말을 되새기면서 다음과 같이 제안합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">첫째</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">현재 고교내신등급 산출방법인 상대평가제는 절대평가제</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">성취평가제</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">로 바뀌어야 합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">둘째</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">상대평가로 경쟁과 서열화를 조장하는 대학수학능력시험는 폐지되거나 절대평가제로 전환되어야 합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고맙습니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"16611\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"d